id: pm-zd46m7
title: "GH-1507: Explain effective default list ordering in brief rows and metadata"
description: "Verified on current source: pm list --status open --limit3 --json returns only id status type title, projection.fields matches those four, and sorting reports default/asc. GitHub1507 asks for the actual default ordering keys and visible priority without requiring a second --fields read. Keep the completed explicit-sort fix pm-gh1481 closed and preserve the compact default TOON projection from pm-6pycus. Implement the effective sort contract in the SDK for CLI MCP and extensions with additive compatible envelope metadata."
